      "formula": "\\begin{gathered}r_t=d\\nu_t/d\\pi,\\quad L=P-I\\\\ \\partial_t\\chi^2(\\nu_t\\Vert\\pi)=-2\\mathcal E_P(r_t,r_t)\\\\ \\operatorname{Var}_\\pi(f)\\leq C_P\\mathcal E_P(f,f)\\\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\chi^2_t\\leq e^{-2t/C_P}\\chi^2_0\\end{gathered}",
