      "formula": "\\begin{gathered}\\partial_t\\operatorname{KL}(\\nu_t\\Vert\\pi)=-\\mathcal E_P(r_t,\\log r_t)\\\\ \\operatorname{Ent}_\\pi(r)\\leq C_M\\mathcal E_P(r,\\log r)\\\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{KL}_t\\leq e^{-t/C_M}\\operatorname{KL}_0\\end{gathered}",
      "mechanism": "A PL-shaped energy-dissipation inequality gives entropy decay. Finite jumps use the logarithmic difference rather than the diffusion spatial-gradient chain rule.",
